 s is a tournament to discover who has the sharpest colour memory\, in the 
 West End of Toronto.\nDialed.gg is a browser-based game built on the premi
 se that humans can't reliably recall colours. The core idea is to memorize
  a set of five colours\, then reproduce them from memory using an HSB pick
 er.\nRuleset\nHSB picker only. No colour-picker browser extensions\, scree
 nshots\, or external reference tools.\nMouse navigation + trackpad accepte
 d.\nRequirements\nEnjoyer of colour\nAn eligible device to play dialed.gg 
 on\nHeart of gold\, abundance mindset\n\nHosted by New & 3 others
